    "text": "By Webmaster ,\n7 hours ago Mail@bradfordvillebugle.comThe annual Tallahassee Turkey Trot will take place Thanksgiving morning at 4055 Esplanade Way, between Merchants Row and Shumard Oak Boulevard. The 1-Mile Race begins at 8 a.m., followed by the 5K, 10K, and 15K races at 8:30 a.m. All events will conclude by 10:30 a.m. Participants can pick up... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
